    "created_at": "2017-03-03T16:27:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-03T16:27:10Z",
    "body": "Yes, a library will need to do more work when it tries to account for others. HTML generally doesn't try to account for multiple libraries and I'm not entirely sure we should start here, if at all.\r\n\r\nDid this come up in practice?",
